{
  "_comment": "Self-play with a KL penalty to the base model (Check-in 5): identical to selfplay.json except kl_coef = 0.05 (per-token k3 estimate of KL(policy || base), weighted like GRPO's beta; see train_single.reinforce_update) and 60 steps instead of 30. The penalty targets the reply-length collapse seen in 4 of 9 runs without it. Checkpoints every 10 steps, so step 30 compares directly with the runs without the penalty and step 60 is the longer run.",
